{"id":"633c2d970d6483e6","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-sigma-bounded-definable-function.md","title":"Sigma-bounded Definable Function","display":"df-sigma-bounded-definable-function — Sigma-bounded Definable Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-sigma-bounded-definable-function","aliases":["72-df-sigma-bounded-definable-function"],"display":"df-sigma-bounded-definable-function — Sigma-bounded Definable Function","depends_on":["[[72-df-substitution-formula]]","[[72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy]]","[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]"],"source_author":"Samuel R. Buss","source_chapter":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)","source_sections":"§1.3.3.2","source_printed_pages":"102","source_pdf_pages":"114","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-sigma-bounded-definable-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-sigma-bounded-definable-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sigma-bounded-definable-function — Sigma-bounded Definable Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bab190ea1c0904c8\" href=\"?note=bab190ea1c0904c8\" title=\"72-df-substitution-formula\">72-df-substitution-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"95a33888a8fb67bb\" href=\"?note=95a33888a8fb67bb\" title=\"72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy\">72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Samuel R. Buss"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)"},{"key":"source_sections","html":"§1.3.3.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"102"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"114"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\geq1\">\\(i\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_i^b\">\\(\\Sigma_i^b\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"95a33888a8fb67bb\" href=\"?note=95a33888a8fb67bb\" title=\"72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy\">72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_j=v_j\">\\(x_j=v_j\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\omega\">\\(j\\in\\omega\\)</span> 固定；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=v_k\">\\(y=v_k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=v_{k+1}\">\\(z=v_{k+1}\\)</span> 为固定互异对象变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})\">\\(\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(\\vec x,y)\">\\(A(\\vec x,y)\\)</span> 的自由变量包含于所显示变量中。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(\\vec x,z)\">\\(A(\\vec x,z)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bab190ea1c0904c8\" href=\"?note=bab190ea1c0904c8\" title=\"72-df-substitution-formula\">72-df-substitution-formula</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}}(A,z,y)\">\\(\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}}(A,z,y)\\)</span>；采用该接口的确定性捕获避免代入，不把选择改名代表留给读者。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}\">\\(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\)</span> 及标准满足关系均取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a> 中的明确接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega^k\\to\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega^k\\to\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SigmaDef}_{i,k}(T,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{SigmaDef}_{i,k}(T,A)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_i(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_i(T)\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SigmaDef}_{i,k}(T,A)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA\\in\\Sigma_i^b\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1},y\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land T\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists y\\;\\bigl(A(\\vec x,y)\\land\\forall z(A(\\vec x,z)\\to z=y)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_{i,k}(T):=\\{f:\\omega^k\\to\\omega:\\;&amp;\n\\exists A\\;[\\mathrm{SigmaDef}_{i,k}(T,A)\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;[f(\\vec n)=m\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\models A[\\vec n,m]]]\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_i(T)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_{i,k}(T).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SigmaDef}_{i,k}(T,A)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA\\in\\Sigma_i^b\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1},y\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land T\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists y\\;\\bigl(A(\\vec x,y)\\land\\forall z(A(\\vec x,z)\\to z=y)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_{i,k}(T):=\\{f:\\omega^k\\to\\omega:\\;&amp;\n\\exists A\\;[\\mathrm{SigmaDef}_{i,k}(T,A)\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;[f(\\vec n)=m\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\models A[\\vec n,m]]]\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_i(T)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_{i,k}(T).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ch. II §1.3.3.2，印刷 p. 102（PDF p. 114）。函数的图公式不仅存在见证，还须在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 内证明存在唯一性。</li>\n<li>这与只提取某个满足关系的选择函数不同；新增原子供 witnessing 定理中原书的精确函数类结论复用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"bab190ea1c0904c8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-substitution-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"95a33888a8fb67bb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"95a33888a8fb67bb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$i\\geq1$，$k\\in\\omega$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})$；$\\Sigma_i^b$ 取 [[72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"bab190ea1c0904c8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A(\\vec x,z)$ 使用 [[72-df-substitution-formula]] 的 $\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}}(A,z,y)$；采用该接口的确定性捕获避免代入，不把选择改名代表留给读者。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\vdash$、$\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}$ 及标准满足关系均取 [[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]] 中的明确接口。$f:\\omega^k\\to\\omega$；$\\mathrm{SigmaDef}_{i,k}(T,A)$ 与 $\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_i(T)$ 由下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"i\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_i^b","display":false},{"tex":"x_j=v_j","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"y=v_k","display":false},{"tex":"z=v_{k+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})","display":false},{"tex":"A(\\vec x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"A(\\vec x,z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}}(A,z,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\omega^k\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SigmaDef}_{i,k}(T,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_i(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SigmaDef}_{i,k}(T,A)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow{}&\nA\\in\\Sigma_i^b\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1},y\\}\\\\\n&\\land T\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists y\\;\\bigl(A(\\vec x,y)\\land\\forall z(A(\\vec x,z)\\to z=y)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_{i,k}(T):=\\{f:\\omega^k\\to\\omega:\\;&\n\\exists A\\;[\\mathrm{SigmaDef}_{i,k}(T,A)\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\\\\n&[f(\\vec n)=m\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\models A[\\vec n,m]]]\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_i(T)&:=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_{i,k}(T).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":2800,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-238","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-sigma-bounded-definable-function|df-sigma-bounded-definable-function — Sigma-bounded Definable Function]]"},{"id":"58e12abc814f8c50","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_i(T)$、$\\mathrm{DeltaPredicates}_i(T)$ 分别取 [[72-df-sigma-bounded-definable-function]]、[[72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate]]；$\\vdash$ 为固定经典一阶可证性。"}],"outgoing":["bab190ea1c0904c8","95a33888a8fb67bb","5635e2f9f2823a2f"]}